    "body": "Update from M5's review of PR #1597: this is **not only verify-caught**. On a **turned stock** (where the program sim refuses to judge) the stock-source Adaptive2D/Pocket cut 7 mm into the part **posts with no finding**. Filed with the area-offset/extension variants as a P1; see the new issue linked from #1597's review. This issue's own P3 rating predates that finding; the maintainer may want to re-rate or fold it.",
